Date: Sun, 19 Jul 2026 15:48:17 +0900
Subject: [PATCH 8/8] [ax_vrr] refine dynamic refresh rate policy

Limit dynamic mode to the configured global peak refresh rate instead of
using the highest panel mode for normal interaction. This keeps 144/165 Hz
available for manual and per-app selections while avoiding unnecessary use
during regular scrolling.

Pick the interactive refresh rate with tolerance so panels reporting 120 Hz
as values like 120.00001 are handled correctly instead of falling back to
90 Hz.

Refresh touch votes on down/move/up events so normal interaction can hold
the intended interactive rate, and stop forcing the notification shade to
stay interactive just because it is expanded. QS can still boost while being
used, but idle QS is allowed to fall back through dynamic mode.

Change-Id: I1ac51ac064d79bbd4cb8c675b97b0b4afe448ada
